        <mxCell id="n43" value="net_amount = paid_amount − COALESCE(refunded_amount, 0)&#10;&#10;退款先聚合，避免一对多连接放大支付额。&#10;退款回溯到原支付日；日期分区需重算。&#10;检查：支付键唯一、币种一致、退款不超支付。" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=17;fontColor=#172B4D;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#B8C6D9;arcSize=12;spacing=10;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontSize=14;fontColor=#172B4D;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
